  "releaseNotes": "Fix: the page no longer flashes back over the screen behind after a committed swipe. It stays parked off-screen while the navigation started in OnSwipedBack lands and is put back only if nothing removed it within RestoreDelayInMilliseconds (new option, default 300).",
